Cell["\<\
When the argument is a Young tableau the shape is read off and the dimension \
depends only on that shape; the explicit standard tableau {{1,2},{3}} has \
shape {2,1}, so the irrep dimension is 2:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->117508239,ExpressionUUID->"c2af1b23-0d85-4676-aa7a-93bc6f9cc0c3"],

